{"data":{"body":"**[P2] Do not pass recognized envelopes to user SerDes when no offloader is configured.** This shortcut lets unsupported/malformed envelopes be accepted by a pass-through SerDes and turns reference envelopes into misleading user-deserialization failures. Preserve lazy status/history inspection if needed, but make result access delegate recognized envelopes to `PayloadCodec` so it fails closed; apply the same fix to operation payloads and test null-offloader cases.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOQwbyFc7ogVtz","finding_digest":"c3204dcf9aa23ecf12b9aa2ed81d3a30bbfa9b6b4cce209b019d8ad6d6fb92fe","finding_id":"arf_v1_ymqe3t42ui7m6evzvixnqhj2gc","finding_key":"sdk-testing/historyeventprocessor::resolveexecutionpayload::missing-offloader-envelope-validation","identity_key":"sdk-testing/historyeventprocessor::resolveexecutionpayload::missing-offloader-envelope-validation","line":290,"observation_digest":"23e91cba473a5f30ae93275120eb7cad2bae55cbf36ab8d0eb5ab3014d405068","observation_id":"aro_v1_epurzoshhjptblute5isb234vu","path":"sdk-testing/src/main/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/testing/cloud/HistoryEventProcessor.java","prior_finding_id":"","published_at":"2026-09-01T04:32:29Z","review_id":"arr_v1_67m2avxtdegta6ou2vtjblow23","reviewed_base_sha":"391d78894ba4e215c07a88dcc3ce20288f41d405","reviewed_head_sha":"8b41c737c9707ad1ddf819406f2e8ac93b7c0f28","reviewer":"codex","start_line":290,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":649},"record_id":"art_v1_f2fcsp5iwrzjpf433tzz4r5k4j","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-09-01T04:32:29Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-java","id":1124528661},"schema_version":1}
